everything else unchanged (`43` is the loop counter, restored). Theorem `selP_sp`, cost
`(n' + 1) * (30 * uC A DD)`.

**Counts** (`cntP iPre iPost iN`): pushes `pre` on `37` (`rNB`), `2 post` on `39` (`rM`),
