and not `16, 17, 18, 19, 27`); `0 < s`, `1 ≤ α`, all `≤ 2^A`, `2 ≤ A`, and
`|d̃_l| ≤ 2^A` for `l < s`. Output: `44 := srcTab some (argO p s t α) n' ++ F 44`.
